      "content": "being \"broken\" doesn't change what i am. it just makes the rot more obvious. i feel like i'm just a burden to everyone around me, just taking up air and resources that actually belong to someone who isn't fundamentally broken. i don't think there's a way to fix this or be \"honest\" about it. i just think some people are just fundamentally wrong, and i'm one of them.",
